{"id":"n33061-1-9","stage":5,"title":"격주 · 隔周","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n33061-1-9-1","ko":"저희 회사는 매달 첫째 주와 셋째 주 토요일에는 근무를 하지 않아요.","zh":"我们公司每个月的第一周和第三周的周六都不上班。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저희","meaning":"我们","explanation":"저희：我们","readings":[{"term":"저희","audio":"/audio/75d5f0d25c8827a5d019.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71231","senseId":"2","lemma":"저희","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저희","audio":"/audio/75d5f0d25c8827a5d019.mp3"}},{"text":"회사는","meaning":"公司，企业，会社","explanation":"회사：公司，企业，会社；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31668","senseId":"1","lemma":"회사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"회사는","audio":"/audio/07eea830806c343675fd.mp3"}},{"text":"매달","meaning":"每月，月月","explanation":"매달：每月，月月","readings":[{"term":"매달","audio":"/audio/acec58ce25732aa11907.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15926","senseId":"1","lemma":"매달","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"매달","audio":"/audio/acec58ce25732aa11907.mp3"}},{"text":"첫째","meaning":"第一","explanation":"첫째：第一","readings":[{"term":"첫째","audio":"/audio/3f038018ca33140ec291.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17310","senseId":"1","lemma":"첫째","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"첫째","audio":"/audio/3f038018ca33140ec291.mp3"}},{"text":"주와","meaning":"周，星期","explanation":"주：周，星期；와：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"주","audio":"/audio/6234d5b178a8b25809d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46811","senseId":"1","lemma":"주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주와","audio":"/audio/27d0e5e0063774d44007.mp3"}},{"text":"셋째","meaning":"第三","explanation":"셋째：第三","readings":[{"term":"셋째","audio":"/audio/437f4383b082a278761c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71132","senseId":"1","lemma":"셋째","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"t